id: pm-gantt-chart-hjs4
title: Scope preflight override to pm-gantt-chart's owned command
description: "registerPreflight used the bare-function (global) form, which collides pairwise with every other installed package's preflight override (pm health reports extension_preflight_override_collision). Rewrite it to the scoped object form declaring the gantt command path the override owns. The override is a pure pass-through that advertises the preflight capability; the real data-sanity gate stays in the command handler. The redundant inner command check (dead once the override is scoped, since the runtime only invokes run for declared commands) is removed to keep coverage at 100%."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-14T06:12:41.982Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-14T06:14:50.073Z"
