completed_at: "2026-08-14T06:14:50.058Z"
author: pi-agent
files[3]{path,scope}:
  index.ts,project
  test/handler.test.ts,project
  test/smoke.test.ts,project
tests[1]{command,path,scope,note}:
  npm test,test/smoke.test.ts,project,"Asserts registerPreflight is a scoped object whose commands array equals pm-gantt-chart's owned command path (gantt) and run is a function. Test title: preflight override is scoped to pm-gantt-chart's owned command path. Companion test in handler.test.ts asserts the scoped override declines (overridden: false) for a non-owned command."
